              "text": "You do not have to feel afraid. You do have to feel useful. Learn the science, question the numbers, and tell people whatever you discover.",
              "words": 25,
              "sentences": 3,
              "avg_sentence_words": 8.3,
              "fk_grade": 4.2,
              "speak_seconds_est": 15.8,
              "fits_20s": true,
              "provenance": "authored-replacement"
            },
            "B1": {
              "text": "Fear will not help us here. Curiosity is far stronger, so study the science, question the numbers you are given, and tell people honestly what you find out.",
              "words": 28,
              "sentences": 2,
              "avg_sentence_words": 14.0,
              "fk_grade": 6.3,
              "speak_seconds_est": 15.3,
              "fits_20s": true,
              "provenance": "authored-replacement"
